<title>USA: Amtech wins $1.7 mln furnace system order.</title>
<headline>Amtech wins $1.7 mln furnace system order.</headline>
<dateline>TEMPE, Ariz. 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amtech Systems Inc on Tuesday said it received a $1.7 million order to produce its eight-inch Tempress horizontal diffusion furnace system for use in making semiconductors.</p>
<p>The purchaser is a leading maker of DRAM (dynamic random access memory) chips in Korea, Amtech said.</p>
<p>Each system would be supplied with three processing chambers, a gas delivery system and an Amtech class 10 load station, the company said in a statement.</p>
